ll other cells of a square can be arbitrary."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/a980c8a7896ad9f6495999602e08cd6a2e70a48c66948461f8dae74282b90cfa.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that a ''"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Z-pattern"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" can consist of only one cell (see the examples)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So he wants to count the number of ''"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Z-pattern"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"s in the country (a necessary skill for Zbazi)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now your task is to help tourist with counting number of ''"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Z-pattern"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"s."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As input/output can reach huge size it is recommended to use fast input/output methods: for example, prefer to use "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gets/scanf/printf"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" instead of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"getline/cin/cout"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in C++, prefer to use "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"BufferedReader/PrintWriter"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" instead of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scanner/System.out"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Java"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n, m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 3000"},{"kind"